= September 2024 — The water arrives before the protocol

Floodwater has entered homes, hospitals and town squares around Kłodzko and
Nysa. Volunteer firefighters and professional rescue crews are moving people
before compensation forms exist; mayors are publishing needs faster than the
centre can verify them.

Prime Minister **[+ prime_minister +]** controls the national response. [? if
left_in_government: Lewica shares responsibility for rescue money and can choose
whether it travels through local command, a central promise or a climate-
adaptation programme.?][? if not left_in_government: The cabinet controls
rescue and compensation. Lewica can finance municipal coordination and
oversight or make reconstruction policy from opposition; it cannot command the
services.?]

Displaced households need speed. The towns which will still be there after the
cameras need a fund they can audit and a river policy that remembers why the
water reached them.

- @flood_local
- @flood_central
- @flood_climate

