Engineers, mayors and environmental planners put retention, river space and
resilient public buildings into the reconstruction brief. [? if
left_in_government: Cabinet plans and future spending now carry those duties.?]
[? if not left_in_government: Our municipal network can publish the plan and
organise towns around it, while national funding remains a government choice.?]

The proposal may prevent the next disaster and does not dry today's home. PSL
hears new obligations for rural land; displaced residents judge whether future
safety is being added to compensation or used to delay it.

- @poland_event_queue: Put the adaptation plan on the events desk

